msgid "Services for messaging handles"
msgstr "Servetschs per nums d'utilisader da messadis"

#: src/postulo/plugins/messaging_services/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which messaging services a handle can be on — Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema — and what a handle on each one looks like. A handle on none of them is listed as “Other”. Nothing here is ever looked up online."
msgstr "Sin tge servetschs da messadis ch'in num d'utilisader po esser — Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema — e co ch'in num d'utilisader sin mintgin vesa ora. In num d'utilisader sin nagin dad els vegn enumerà sco «Auter». Nagut qua na vegn mai tschertgà online."
